OL,3,GNEWSATfL staff subjected to abuse 'on
OL,4,Adaily basis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport for London (TfL) staff have
OL,7,Fsaid they face "shocking" levels of
OL,8,Fabuse, with incidents including hate
OL,9,Fspeech, spitting and physical assaults
OL,10,Ftaking place "on a daily basis".
OL,12,FA total of 3,922 abuse incidents
OL,13,Finvolving London Underground and
OL,14,FOverground staff were recorded in the
OL,15,Fyear to March 2026, according to
OL,16,Ffigures gathered by Press Association.
OL,18,FHalf involved verbal or gesture abuse,
OL,19,Fabout 29% were threatening incidents
OL,20,Fand 21% were physical assaults. More
OL,21,Fthan one in 10 involved hate-related
OL,22,Fabuse.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
