OL,3,GNEWSATfL staff subjected to abuse 'on
OL,4,Adaily basis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTfL said the Freedom of Information
OL,7,F(FOI) figures were not surprising
OL,8,Fbecause staff were "well aware of
OL,9,Fwhat's been happening out on our
OL,10,Fnetwork".
